WEBVTT

01:30.320 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:45.960 --> 01:48.280
You condensed the power of nine suns
in an instant,

01:49.040 --> 01:50.640
breaking through
the Jade Vault's restriction!

01:52.400 --> 01:54.480
The Lava cannot hold me.

01:55.800 --> 01:58.760
Xie Xuechen's Jade Vault restriction
cannot hold me either.

01:59.400 --> 02:00.680
Your killing array

02:01.200 --> 02:03.120
is no match for me at all.

02:09.919 --> 02:11.160
This Book of Fate

02:11.240 --> 02:13.680
is filled with the world's nonsense.

02:13.760 --> 02:15.480
Now, let me

02:16.240 --> 02:17.600
personally destroy it!

02:20.040 --> 02:21.200
This pain spanning 10,000 years

02:21.280 --> 02:24.200
shall be removed from its very root.

02:33.520 --> 02:34.720
EVIL EMPEROR ZHAO MING DEFIED HEAVEN
TO DESTROY DEITIES

02:34.800 --> 02:36.000
DESCENDED INTO A DEMON
AND WAS IMPRISONED IN THE LAVA

02:41.040 --> 02:43.080
It's shielded by Fate's barrier.

02:43.760 --> 02:45.680
What exactly is recorded on this page?

02:53.600 --> 02:54.960
A divine artifact cannot harbor emotions,

02:55.640 --> 02:57.000
nor can it love!

02:57.080 --> 02:59.320
Otherwise,
it will be destroyed in this world.

02:59.400 --> 03:00.720
I want to stay here,

03:02.120 --> 03:02.960
waiting for Zhao Ming's return.

03:03.720 --> 03:06.360
When emotional veins spread
from the heart to the fingertips,

03:06.440 --> 03:08.000
heavenly punishment will descend.

03:08.080 --> 03:09.200
That will mark the end of existence.

03:09.280 --> 03:10.400
I don't want to return
to the Celestial Altar.

03:10.480 --> 03:11.720
I want to be a person with feelings,
just once.

03:11.800 --> 03:14.080
For this so-called love,

03:14.160 --> 03:15.160
you would rather die?

03:15.240 --> 03:16.840
How can the Qiankun Pearl save Zhao Ming
from his death fate?

03:16.920 --> 03:18.240
Fate cannot be altered.

03:18.320 --> 03:19.760
The life-and-death fate is inevitable!

03:19.840 --> 03:21.440
The Qiankun Pearl
can only transfer the harm.

03:21.520 --> 03:23.760
-How will it transfer?
-Between you and Zhao Ming, one must die!

03:23.840 --> 03:25.440
Zhao Ming, I love you.

03:25.520 --> 03:27.400
I want to marry you. Will you marry me?

03:27.480 --> 03:29.760
Divinity is not about race,
nor about lineage.

03:29.840 --> 03:31.000
Only those with compassion

03:31.080 --> 03:33.280
and who protect all beings
are truly divine.

03:33.360 --> 03:35.640
I will also fall into sleep soon,
losing all my memories,

03:35.720 --> 03:36.800
unable to save Zhao Ming again.

03:36.880 --> 03:39.280
Only by casting his blood essence
into the cycle of rebirth

03:39.360 --> 03:41.680
can there be hope
for a reunion thousands of years later.

03:50.720 --> 03:51.680
MARRIAGE AGREEMENT

03:52.520 --> 03:57.400
MARRIAGE AGREEMENT

04:19.880 --> 04:20.959
Jun Tian!

04:23.720 --> 04:25.720
The Jun Tian Sword
hasn't recognized a master.

04:26.400 --> 04:28.280
You cannot seize it by force.

04:29.040 --> 04:30.440
What if it hasn't chosen a master?

04:30.520 --> 04:33.080
Only I can wield the Jun Tian Sword!

04:47.520 --> 04:48.760
For 10,000 years,

04:48.840 --> 04:51.480
you've defied me
with a disguise of obedience.

04:51.560 --> 04:54.360
It seems the punishment
wasn't harsh enough.

04:55.920 --> 04:57.360
Hao Tian,

04:58.800 --> 05:01.680
I will fully activate the emotional curse,

05:01.760 --> 05:05.440
making you suffer the piercing pain
worse than death!

05:11.080 --> 05:12.880
When the curse takes effect,

05:12.960 --> 05:15.800
it will finally destroy
both your form and spirit.

05:15.880 --> 05:17.640
Time is running out.

05:17.720 --> 05:19.080
Think carefully.

05:19.160 --> 05:21.160
Will you fulfill my will

05:21.240 --> 05:22.680
and help me descend

05:22.760 --> 05:25.600
or wait to perish in this ice and snow?

05:29.240 --> 05:30.920
Your Grace, was your journey smooth?

05:31.000 --> 05:32.720
Shall I massage your joints for you?

05:32.800 --> 05:33.680
Your… Your Grace!

05:34.240 --> 05:35.080
Hey, enough.

05:35.160 --> 05:36.080
TEMPLE OF DIVINE EXECUTION

05:36.160 --> 05:37.600
Don't you have any sense?

05:37.680 --> 05:39.280
Look at His Grace's expression.

05:39.360 --> 05:40.440
Something must have happened.

05:41.760 --> 05:43.520
What… What happened exactly?

06:38.840 --> 06:40.520
Why have you come?

06:45.440 --> 06:46.560
I'm here to take you back.

06:48.840 --> 06:52.880
How can your trivial strength
possibly move me?

07:22.520 --> 07:26.240
Such stubbornness cannot defy me neither.

07:26.760 --> 07:28.200
If you do not stop,

07:28.280 --> 07:30.200
you will meet your end.

07:59.240 --> 08:00.160
Return…

08:00.800 --> 08:01.800
Feng Yao…

08:21.720 --> 08:22.560
Feng Yao…

08:38.000 --> 08:38.840
I will…

08:38.919 --> 08:39.880
-Return…
-take you…

08:42.200 --> 08:43.360
home!

08:51.320 --> 08:52.840
Feng Yao!

09:34.320 --> 09:36.400
For the sake of this mere mortal,

09:36.920 --> 09:39.240
would you sacrifice your own life?

09:41.240 --> 09:42.640
For 10,000 years,

09:45.440 --> 09:47.920
I sought to resolve the crisis

09:49.440 --> 09:52.360
through deception and lies.

09:54.400 --> 09:57.440
I even considered destroying
the strongest in this world,

09:58.760 --> 10:01.320
so that you could never descend.

10:06.360 --> 10:08.920
But at this moment, I suddenly realized

10:11.560 --> 10:14.440
that even removing the strongest

10:16.600 --> 10:18.840
would change nothing.

10:20.920 --> 10:23.520
As long as you exist,

10:25.200 --> 10:27.560
nothing will ever change.

10:30.760 --> 10:32.600
Perhaps it's time

10:34.280 --> 10:36.680
to try a different way to resolve this.

10:43.760 --> 10:45.440
What do you intend to do?

10:47.000 --> 10:48.840
In this so-called chess game,

10:49.800 --> 10:52.440
the player thoughtfully calculates,

10:53.880 --> 10:59.040
using pawns to win within the rules.

11:02.560 --> 11:04.440
But what if the rules themselves…

11:07.920 --> 11:09.920
are flawed at their core?

11:11.800 --> 11:13.280
Would the player

11:14.720 --> 11:16.440
still continue the game?

11:25.240 --> 11:27.720
You control me with the emotional curse,

11:28.320 --> 11:30.400
threatening me with death!

11:32.240 --> 11:34.440
Now, I don't need you to act.

11:35.800 --> 11:38.480
I can burn my own soul to ash.

11:39.160 --> 11:41.480
Even if the emotional curse
doesn't activate,

11:42.080 --> 11:44.760
I can end myself!

11:44.840 --> 11:47.280
I can remove the emotional curse for you.

11:47.360 --> 11:50.000
There's no need to threaten me
with burning your soul.

12:06.240 --> 12:07.240
Hao Tian,

12:07.320 --> 12:10.000
even you have moments of tension!

12:16.200 --> 12:18.040
I've removed the emotional curse.

12:18.120 --> 12:20.600
Why do you still fight to the death?

12:20.680 --> 12:23.480
Self-destruction is a poor strategy!

12:23.560 --> 12:25.200
Does it matter if it's poor?

12:29.840 --> 12:31.520
From now on,

12:32.800 --> 12:35.000
you'll never control me again.

12:37.440 --> 12:39.760
Even if my soul is vanished,

12:39.840 --> 12:41.680
I will reclaim my freedom.

12:42.840 --> 12:44.480
You should be the one to worry.

12:45.360 --> 12:47.800
The Book of Fate will no longer exist

12:47.880 --> 12:49.760
with my fall.

12:50.360 --> 12:52.840
How will your rules of the heavenly order

12:53.360 --> 12:55.520
be enforced then?

12:55.600 --> 12:57.680
You're utterly foolish!

12:57.760 --> 13:00.160
Even if you escape my control,

13:00.240 --> 13:02.880
I will still descend upon this world soon.

13:02.960 --> 13:05.960
When that time comes, you'll see

13:06.040 --> 13:08.360
that today's efforts were all in vain!

13:44.760 --> 13:46.400
Why go to such lengths?

13:47.480 --> 13:49.120
I don't love you after all.

13:52.920 --> 13:54.240
Nor do I love you.

13:57.240 --> 13:58.280
The one I love…

13:59.360 --> 14:00.960
is the person from 11 years ago,

14:02.040 --> 14:03.840
beneath the umbrella in the rain.

14:07.640 --> 14:09.040
Do you believe…

14:10.320 --> 14:11.520
in this world…

14:12.480 --> 14:15.040
someone could fall in love
with their own memory?

14:16.480 --> 14:18.520
Fall in love with the person
in their memory?

14:19.360 --> 14:20.400
So…

14:23.160 --> 14:25.200
what exactly is love?

14:26.600 --> 14:27.640
Love…

14:28.960 --> 14:30.560
is beyond expression.

14:32.680 --> 14:33.840
Perhaps…

14:34.720 --> 14:36.640
you'll never truly understand it.

14:38.040 --> 14:39.360
Or maybe…

14:41.360 --> 14:42.760
in an instant…

14:45.320 --> 14:46.640
you'll grasp it completely.

14:51.960 --> 14:53.120
My name is Feng Yao.

14:53.640 --> 14:54.840
F-E-N-G

14:55.360 --> 14:56.560
Y-A-O.

14:59.360 --> 15:01.000
If you were to lose everything,

15:01.560 --> 15:03.400
I would still stay by your side,

15:04.000 --> 15:05.440
never abandoning you!

15:49.360 --> 15:50.880
"If disaster strikes,

15:52.120 --> 15:53.680
I'll bear it myself."

15:54.200 --> 15:56.080
So, it was all true.

15:58.040 --> 15:59.560
You treated me with genuine love,

16:00.160 --> 16:02.720
willing to kill deities
and defy the heavens for my sake.

16:04.880 --> 16:05.920
And yet,

16:06.480 --> 16:09.240
I was trapped in those false memories,

16:09.960 --> 16:11.120
blaming you for 10,000 years.

16:11.200 --> 16:12.200
MARRIAGE AGREEMENT

16:12.800 --> 16:13.680
Pearl…

16:17.560 --> 16:18.960
will you blame me?

16:21.480 --> 16:22.960
How could I ever blame you?

16:37.920 --> 16:39.080
Pearl!

16:43.680 --> 16:46.000
You were the most sincere person
in the world,

16:46.520 --> 16:47.880
yet Fate forcibly rewrote your destiny.

16:47.960 --> 16:50.000
You carried the hatred of world

16:50.600 --> 16:52.520
and the memories of betrayal
by your lover,

16:53.560 --> 16:55.920
struggling bitterly for 10,000 years.

16:56.880 --> 16:58.040
During these 10,000 years,

16:58.880 --> 17:00.880
you've endured the greatest suffering.

17:04.920 --> 17:05.920
Pearl,

17:08.400 --> 17:10.119
these 10,000 years felt so long,

17:12.520 --> 17:15.480
long enough to blur truth and lies for me.

17:18.000 --> 17:19.280
All I know is,

17:20.880 --> 17:23.079
I once really protected the people,

17:24.280 --> 17:26.160
and now, I also really hate the world.

17:27.599 --> 17:29.160
But at this moment,

17:30.440 --> 17:31.920
I suddenly feel lost.

17:32.720 --> 17:34.240
If Hao Tian descends

17:34.760 --> 17:35.800
and all beings are destroyed,

17:36.800 --> 17:38.280
what kind of feeling

17:38.920 --> 17:40.520
will that be for me?

17:43.240 --> 17:44.640
I know that feeling.

17:45.920 --> 17:48.880
Once, I was merely a pearl,

17:50.040 --> 17:52.840
believing that all things in this world
were irrelevant to me.

17:53.640 --> 17:55.480
But then I met you.

17:56.400 --> 17:57.520
As I grew closer to you,

17:59.040 --> 18:01.400
I understood the meaning
of this world to me.

18:04.280 --> 18:05.560
For one person,

18:07.840 --> 18:09.600
I was willing to protect all beings.

18:11.120 --> 18:12.960
That was the strength you gave me.

18:16.400 --> 18:17.440
And now,

18:17.960 --> 18:19.320
I'll return this strength

18:21.240 --> 18:22.280
to you.

18:25.600 --> 18:26.800
In dreams,

18:27.320 --> 18:28.720
in illusions,

18:29.960 --> 18:31.960
I've seen you countless times.

18:34.600 --> 18:35.800
This time

18:36.480 --> 18:38.560
is nothing more than my delusion again.

18:40.920 --> 18:42.120
My Pearl

18:43.920 --> 18:45.600
will never come back.

18:51.720 --> 18:52.960
No matter when,

18:53.720 --> 18:55.160
I will always be by your side,

18:55.680 --> 18:57.080
in your heart.

19:02.640 --> 19:03.920
But in your heart,

19:04.000 --> 19:05.400
there is not just me,

19:06.280 --> 19:07.520
there are all living beings as well.

19:09.680 --> 19:10.840
Whether it's dark thoughts

19:10.920 --> 19:12.760
clouding your eyes

19:12.840 --> 19:14.520
or obsessions veiling your heart,

19:15.320 --> 19:17.600
whenever you feel lost and confused,

19:21.520 --> 19:23.280
remember to ask your heart.

19:26.280 --> 19:27.520
It will guide you

19:28.040 --> 19:30.040
to find the answers you seek.

19:31.040 --> 19:34.080
The one who can guide you is not me,

19:34.680 --> 19:36.400
nor anyone else.

19:37.960 --> 19:39.480
It is you yourself.

19:43.040 --> 19:44.520
Saint Emperor Zhao Ming,

19:45.320 --> 19:46.840
Fallen Deity Zhao Ming,

19:48.040 --> 19:49.320
Demon Lord Zhao Ming…

19:52.080 --> 19:53.840
The one who decides who you are

19:54.920 --> 19:56.320
is only you.

19:57.760 --> 19:58.680
The answer

19:59.920 --> 20:01.640
has always been within your heart.

20:15.880 --> 20:17.480
Ask my heart…

20:26.440 --> 20:27.320
Pearl!

20:29.200 --> 20:31.040
Pearl! Pearl!

20:31.560 --> 20:32.640
Pearl!

20:47.360 --> 20:48.840
You're finally willing to come back.

20:53.840 --> 20:54.960
On this journey,

20:55.880 --> 20:57.840
I thought everything was under control,

20:58.680 --> 21:00.280
but I nearly ruined it all.

21:02.000 --> 21:02.840
Xie Xuechen,

21:04.200 --> 21:05.960
it turns out I wasn't clear-headed either

21:06.760 --> 21:08.040
in this maze of illusions.

21:09.520 --> 21:11.040
The road ahead is no longer

21:11.840 --> 21:13.160
about defying mortals,

21:13.800 --> 21:15.000
nor defying deities,

21:16.880 --> 21:17.960
but defying the Creator.

21:19.960 --> 21:21.080
It sounds

21:21.600 --> 21:23.600
like a path to self-destruction.

21:24.400 --> 21:25.640
But Xie Xuechen,

21:26.280 --> 21:27.360
rest assured.

21:28.760 --> 21:29.880
I have no fear,

21:31.480 --> 21:32.840
and I will never retreat.

21:36.240 --> 21:39.400
FENG YAO'S TOMB

22:00.520 --> 22:04.040
FENG YAO'S TOMB

22:04.120 --> 22:06.600
When did you discover Feng Yao's identity?

22:08.480 --> 22:10.320
The bond between blood relatives

22:11.640 --> 22:13.280
is the most profound.

22:14.480 --> 22:15.960
I had sensed it long ago,

22:16.520 --> 22:17.960
but she didn't want to reunite.

22:18.480 --> 22:21.160
So, I chose to respect
her wishes and wait.

22:21.960 --> 22:23.240
But I didn't expect

22:25.000 --> 22:26.800
there would never be a chance to reunite.

22:28.400 --> 22:30.000
As long as this world

22:30.840 --> 22:32.040
has someone who remembers her,

22:33.080 --> 22:34.280
even if she's gone,

22:35.480 --> 22:36.920
it wouldn't be the end.

22:40.120 --> 22:41.320
And you?

22:42.240 --> 22:43.640
Will you remember her?

22:44.320 --> 22:46.640
The Book of Fate observes silently
across the ages,

22:47.160 --> 22:48.880
its records vast and intricate.

22:48.960 --> 22:52.160
Most people and events
are written in the book

22:52.240 --> 22:53.640
but not in my heart.

22:53.720 --> 22:55.240
Yet, the moment Feng Yao died,

22:56.040 --> 22:57.800
I suddenly realized

22:58.760 --> 23:01.440
that a light phrase, a faint word

23:02.840 --> 23:04.360
in the Book of Fate

23:05.480 --> 23:07.160
could encompass

23:08.040 --> 23:09.840
a lifetime of intertwined joy and sorrow.

23:11.520 --> 23:12.920
Her blood

23:13.720 --> 23:16.320
allowed me to see the world's colors
for the first time

23:18.240 --> 23:19.680
and made me understand

23:20.720 --> 23:21.960
that even in this mortal world,

23:23.240 --> 23:25.760
there are people and things

23:26.280 --> 23:27.440
worth remembering deeply,

23:29.440 --> 23:31.320
even if they have nothing to do with love.

23:46.440 --> 23:48.280
This is the sign of Hao Tian's descent.

23:48.360 --> 23:49.400
Hao Tian?

23:49.480 --> 23:50.800
Fate,

23:51.320 --> 23:53.440
do you think threatening me

23:53.520 --> 23:56.720
with burning your soul
can stop my descent?

23:56.800 --> 23:59.960
The Demon Lord has already glimpsed
the truth of 10,000 years ago,

24:00.040 --> 24:02.720
forging it into ultimate willpower.

24:02.800 --> 24:04.200
The Jun Tian Sword
has recognized its master.

24:04.280 --> 24:06.320
The strongest has reappeared.

24:06.400 --> 24:07.480
In less than three days,

24:07.560 --> 24:09.600
I shall descend completely

24:09.680 --> 24:12.280
and restore order to this chaotic world.

24:12.360 --> 24:14.960
You were behind everything.

24:15.040 --> 24:16.920
This is my will

24:17.000 --> 24:19.200
even fate cannot uncover.

24:19.800 --> 24:21.000
In the unseen,

24:21.080 --> 24:23.520
each of your so-called rebellions

24:23.600 --> 24:26.560
only serves to advance
the inevitable outcome.

24:26.640 --> 24:27.600
Fate,

24:28.120 --> 24:31.560
calmly await the end of days.

24:33.320 --> 24:34.160
At this point,

24:34.240 --> 24:35.600
what can we still do?

24:35.680 --> 24:37.320
Hao Tian plans to end the world.

24:38.200 --> 24:39.440
It's unstoppable.

24:39.520 --> 24:41.480
We can only sit and await our doom?

24:42.440 --> 24:43.280
No.

24:45.440 --> 24:46.800
Perhaps someone

24:48.200 --> 24:50.280
can still turn the tide.

24:51.680 --> 24:52.520
Look!

24:52.600 --> 24:55.360
The Gu Butterflies are flying
out of the Lava on their own!

24:55.920 --> 24:57.520
What's going on?

24:58.200 --> 24:59.880
Signs are appearing everywhere.

25:00.880 --> 25:03.000
An apocalypse is bound to occur.

25:07.240 --> 25:09.720
All realms are showing signs,
mysterious and strange.

25:09.800 --> 25:12.640
This apocalyptic scene
must be Hao Tian's doing.

25:13.400 --> 25:14.240
It has begun.

25:14.320 --> 25:16.240
If the Dark Abyss
shows such obvious signs,

25:17.160 --> 25:18.600
then the human realm
must be in even graver danger.

25:21.160 --> 25:23.240
-Anger Demon! Desire Demon!
-Here!

25:24.040 --> 25:25.400
Quickly head to the human realm

25:25.480 --> 25:26.720
-and invite Fate here.
-Understood!

25:28.760 --> 25:29.720
Look!

25:29.800 --> 25:31.280
-Oh my!
-Run!

25:32.480 --> 25:35.840
-Run!
-Run!

25:36.480 --> 25:37.680
Run!

25:39.520 --> 25:41.280
-Ah!
-Help!

25:41.360 --> 25:42.640
-Run quickly!
-Hurry, run!

26:03.840 --> 26:05.240
This toxic mist can dissolve the barriers!

26:05.320 --> 26:06.680
Spiritual power
is completely ineffective against it!

26:06.760 --> 26:07.960
Sir, let's retreat!

26:09.080 --> 26:09.920
Fall back!

26:11.080 --> 26:12.960
Go, hurry!

26:14.920 --> 26:16.760
-Run!
-Careful!

26:25.000 --> 26:27.320
All disciples of Xuantian Sect,
prepare to protect!

26:49.880 --> 26:52.080
Senior, forcing yourself to resist
with spiritual form power

26:52.160 --> 26:54.320
will lead to backlash from the toxic mist!

26:55.160 --> 26:56.760
Even if the world is doomed,

26:56.840 --> 26:58.920
we cannot give up now.

26:59.000 --> 27:00.680
As long as I stand,

27:01.400 --> 27:02.520
I will defend!

27:04.200 --> 27:05.240
Very well!

27:05.320 --> 27:06.600
The Immortal Alliance is an alliance,

27:06.680 --> 27:07.720
and so we should advance
and retreat together,

27:07.800 --> 27:09.200
sharing life and death!

27:09.280 --> 27:11.760
Advance and retreat together,
share life and death!

27:21.600 --> 27:22.800
Everyone, get on board quickly!

27:22.880 --> 27:25.240
We'll take you to the cliff for shelter!

27:25.320 --> 27:27.320
Don't worry, everyone.
There are enough airships for all.

27:27.400 --> 27:29.160
After this, we'll head to other places
to rescue more people.

27:29.760 --> 27:31.520
Bring the civilians
aboard the Cloud Floating Airship!

27:31.600 --> 27:32.680
Understood!

27:43.440 --> 27:44.800
I never thought

27:45.360 --> 27:46.720
we'd meet again

27:47.240 --> 27:49.440
without swords drawn between us.

27:49.520 --> 27:51.160
As enemies for 10,000 years,

27:52.360 --> 27:53.800
we were meant to fight to the death.

27:54.520 --> 27:55.440
However,

27:56.080 --> 27:57.360
on the eve of the apocalypse,

27:58.000 --> 27:59.680
there's no longer a need for infighting.

28:04.280 --> 28:05.720
At the Everbright Palace 10,000 years ago,

28:05.800 --> 28:07.720
you and I once played a game of chess.

28:08.960 --> 28:10.400
Back then,
we reached an endless situation,

28:11.760 --> 28:14.040
without conclusion, without a victor.

28:15.520 --> 28:16.800
Why not, today,

28:19.240 --> 28:20.640
play another game?

28:25.240 --> 28:27.400
In the game from 10,000 years ago,

28:27.480 --> 28:30.240
you played white, and I played black.

28:30.760 --> 28:32.880
Today, the roles seem reversed.

28:38.760 --> 28:41.320
This world is never simply black or white,

28:41.400 --> 28:43.440
just like the Divine Clan of that time,

28:43.520 --> 28:44.720
claiming to represent the righteous path,

28:45.320 --> 28:46.360
looking down from their high seat,

28:47.160 --> 28:49.640
yet lacking mercy and sowing slaughter.

28:49.720 --> 28:51.040
They were never worthy
of being called deities.

28:51.120 --> 28:53.680
So, they fell into
what is now the Dark Clan.

28:56.840 --> 28:58.800
One thought makes a deity,
one makes a demon.

28:59.600 --> 29:01.080
It has always been so.

29:01.880 --> 29:03.600
Whether black or white, it doesn't matter.

29:04.760 --> 29:06.040
What matters is

29:06.720 --> 29:08.800
I will never be a pawn,

29:10.000 --> 29:11.520
nor will I ever be controlled by Hao Tian.

29:15.280 --> 29:18.400
All things in this world
were created by Hao Tian.

29:19.080 --> 29:20.520
If you don't want to be controlled,

29:20.600 --> 29:21.840
what else can you do?

29:29.960 --> 29:32.080
Even the Book of Fate following his will

29:33.480 --> 29:35.800
has had thoughts
of defying Hao Tian, right?

29:37.720 --> 29:39.920
Otherwise, you wouldn't
have agreed to come here.

29:41.080 --> 29:42.200
Now that you're here,

29:43.200 --> 29:44.160
you may as well speak plainly.

29:55.560 --> 29:57.600
This apocalypse

29:58.600 --> 30:01.200
should've happened 10,000 years ago.

30:02.240 --> 30:04.600
No one knows where Hao Tian came from

30:04.680 --> 30:06.000
or when he appeared.

30:06.080 --> 30:08.240
He is like a set of rules,

30:09.000 --> 30:10.400
yet also like…

30:11.200 --> 30:13.280
an eternal creator of the vast cosmos.

30:15.440 --> 30:17.040
In Hao Tian's eyes,

30:18.280 --> 30:19.800
order is above all else.

30:20.320 --> 30:23.280
Now, the two realms are in chaos,
the divine artifact falls in love,

30:23.360 --> 30:25.960
the four seasons are out of order,
and disasters are widespread.

30:26.040 --> 30:29.240
Relying solely on you to act on my laws
is not enough.

30:29.320 --> 30:32.320
Only the strongest in the world
can be my vessel

30:32.400 --> 30:33.480
and help me descend.

30:33.560 --> 30:34.960
Your Grace,

30:35.520 --> 30:37.720
you actually decide
to personally correct the errors

30:38.240 --> 30:39.320
and save the world?

30:39.920 --> 30:41.800
Rather than fixing the mistakes,

30:41.880 --> 30:43.560
it's better to start over.

30:43.640 --> 30:45.440
Hao Tian is so powerful

30:46.480 --> 30:47.720
that he refuses

30:47.800 --> 30:49.960
to repair the chaotic paths of this world.

30:50.040 --> 30:51.720
When the system runs out of control,

30:52.240 --> 30:53.840
he will destroy the world
and rebuild it anew.

30:54.360 --> 30:56.480
However, Hao Tian lacks a physical form

30:57.000 --> 30:59.000
and cannot directly enter this world.

31:00.080 --> 31:02.280
Only by possessing the strongest

31:02.360 --> 31:03.800
can he descend.

31:04.400 --> 31:05.240
And you,

31:05.920 --> 31:07.360
or rather, Zhao Ming,

31:08.040 --> 31:10.720
are the chosen vessel of Hao Tian.

31:11.960 --> 31:13.520
So, 10,000 years ago,

31:14.880 --> 31:16.720
you sealed me in the Lava,

31:17.320 --> 31:19.000
not to comply with the deities' request

31:19.720 --> 31:20.920
but intentionally.

31:24.280 --> 31:26.640
The day Zhao Ming
ascended to slay the deities

31:27.360 --> 31:29.760
was the day he truly became the strongest.

31:29.840 --> 31:33.120
I then took the opportunity
to make Zhao Ming a fallen deity,

31:33.640 --> 31:35.120
sealing him in the Lava.

31:35.200 --> 31:37.720
This indeed wronged Zhao Ming
over the ages,

31:38.920 --> 31:42.000
but it was the only way
to preserve the world.

31:42.960 --> 31:44.480
Do you think suppressing Zhao Ming

31:44.560 --> 31:46.880
can prevent my descent?

31:47.400 --> 31:50.440
The rules are set, and order endures.

31:50.520 --> 31:53.200
The strongest vessel is immortal.

31:53.280 --> 31:55.960
No matter how it's stopped or altered,

31:56.040 --> 32:00.040
the strongest will inevitably rise again.

32:03.000 --> 32:04.520
Until 10,000 years later,

32:06.200 --> 32:08.280
Hao Tian's plan to end the world

32:09.360 --> 32:10.800
would restart.

32:12.120 --> 32:14.560
It seems these 10,000 years of suffering

32:14.640 --> 32:16.480
have taught you a lesson.

32:16.560 --> 32:19.520
You've learned to obey my will.

32:19.600 --> 32:20.720
As an artifact,

32:21.720 --> 32:23.280
I was meant to follow Your Grace,

32:23.800 --> 32:25.160
carrying out your will.

32:27.600 --> 32:29.120
That is my purpose

32:32.240 --> 32:33.840
and my destiny.

32:35.800 --> 32:37.080
But this time,

32:37.600 --> 32:40.280
I learned to fake compliance

32:40.360 --> 32:41.720
to deceive and outwit.

32:43.040 --> 32:45.240
Still, despite all my schemes,

32:48.000 --> 32:50.920
I couldn't stop
the emergence of the strongest.

32:56.320 --> 32:58.160
Crafting the rules of this world

32:58.920 --> 33:00.840
yet also bound by them,

33:02.560 --> 33:03.960
how absurd.

33:07.720 --> 33:10.200
This world has always been absurd.

33:11.480 --> 33:14.120
I prided myself
on creating the world within the fan,

33:15.280 --> 33:17.560
but the world we live in

33:18.080 --> 33:19.640
is just like a painting within the fan.

33:20.840 --> 33:21.880
All of us

33:23.240 --> 33:24.960
are being indifferently observed

33:25.040 --> 33:26.280
by someone outside the fan.

33:27.880 --> 33:30.200
Ten thousand years ago,
when the heavens were torn open,

33:30.800 --> 33:32.800
I helped the Chaos Pearl mend them.

33:32.880 --> 33:36.640
Then I was swept
into another vast dimension.

33:41.440 --> 33:43.400
For the first time,
I saw there is another heaven

33:43.480 --> 33:44.760
beyond the heavens.

33:45.280 --> 33:47.040
In that space beyond,

33:47.560 --> 33:49.560
I glimpsed the secrets of the world.

33:50.080 --> 33:51.200
This world

33:52.080 --> 33:54.200
is like a painting,

33:55.080 --> 33:57.520
with everything controlled

33:57.600 --> 33:58.760
and predetermined.

33:59.560 --> 34:01.440
I saw the threads of cause and effect,

34:01.960 --> 34:04.560
the origin of this world,

34:04.640 --> 34:06.560
and its eventual destruction.

34:07.320 --> 34:09.719
Only then did I realize our painted world

34:10.239 --> 34:11.960
is as insignificant as dust.

34:12.560 --> 34:14.159
I tried to change it,

34:14.679 --> 34:16.520
but it was in vain.

34:17.360 --> 34:19.719
So, I returned to this world

34:21.040 --> 34:22.600
because those

34:22.679 --> 34:25.880
within the painting
can only act within it.

34:30.679 --> 34:32.520
This boundless universe,

34:33.719 --> 34:35.239
with origins unknown

34:35.800 --> 34:37.280
and an end unknowable,

34:38.360 --> 34:41.239
is filled with mysteries
we cannot realize or explain.

34:45.159 --> 34:46.960
I often wonder.

34:47.880 --> 34:49.800
If there is a heaven beyond the heavens,

34:50.880 --> 34:53.679
might there be something even greater

34:54.800 --> 34:57.320
beyond that?

34:58.560 --> 34:59.680
But for now,

35:00.200 --> 35:01.320
Hao Tian's descent

35:02.160 --> 35:03.920
is an unstoppable force.

35:04.480 --> 35:07.080
Unstoppable does not mean undefeatable.

35:08.720 --> 35:10.400
Since you've come to discuss cooperation,

35:11.240 --> 35:13.000
it means
you've already planned a solution.

35:13.680 --> 35:15.560
And since you invited me here,

35:16.520 --> 35:19.160
it shows you too have thought of a plan
to resolve this crisis.

35:19.240 --> 35:20.960
Let's see

35:21.760 --> 35:23.640
if our ideas align.

35:29.320 --> 35:31.600
Use Hao Tian to slay Hao Tian!

35:31.680 --> 35:33.000
Exactly.

35:33.720 --> 35:35.280
Only the strongest

35:35.800 --> 35:37.000
can fight the strongest.

35:37.080 --> 35:39.160
Only Hao Tian himself

35:39.240 --> 35:40.800
can destroy Hao Tian.

35:43.760 --> 35:46.960
I heard everything you just said.

35:48.600 --> 35:51.200
How could you leave me,
the Keeper of Time,

35:51.280 --> 35:53.320
out of the plan to slay Hao Tian?

35:53.400 --> 35:54.800
Besides,

35:57.600 --> 35:59.240
we've traveled this far together.

35:59.320 --> 36:01.120
This mission to slay Hao Tian

36:01.640 --> 36:02.640
is extremely dangerous.

36:02.720 --> 36:04.920
I won't let you go alone.

36:20.640 --> 36:22.800
Since we were born from chaos,

36:23.320 --> 36:25.360
you've faced so much you couldn't control,

36:25.440 --> 36:26.960
yet you never thought
to discuss it with me.

36:27.600 --> 36:29.320
You always made decisions on your own.

36:34.640 --> 36:35.480
Enough.

36:37.120 --> 36:38.720
Let the past

36:39.920 --> 36:41.040
remain in the past.

36:42.720 --> 36:44.040
From now on,

36:45.960 --> 36:47.480
you'll no longer be alone.

37:00.800 --> 37:01.880
And we

37:02.880 --> 37:04.720
share a common goal.

37:05.240 --> 37:07.280
To destroy Hao Tian.

37:17.320 --> 37:18.400
I never thought

37:18.920 --> 37:21.440
another game of chess after 10,000 years

37:22.240 --> 37:24.560
would still lead to an endless situation.

37:28.120 --> 37:29.920
This game is not between you and me,

37:30.640 --> 37:32.360
but a match against Hao Tian.

37:32.440 --> 37:35.200
The rules of this world
were set by Hao Tian.

37:35.760 --> 37:37.080
These 10,000 years of cause and effect

37:37.600 --> 37:40.400
have been nothing
but an endless cycle of struggle.

37:40.920 --> 37:42.400
You can't defeat the creator of the rules

37:42.920 --> 37:44.560
by following their rules.

37:45.080 --> 37:47.520
Why not overturn the chessboard
from now on

37:47.600 --> 37:49.000
and destroy all the rules?

37:51.920 --> 37:52.840
This time,

37:52.920 --> 37:56.080
I will make sure Hao Tian
disappears completely.

37:57.040 --> 37:58.760
There are three key steps
to slaying Hao Tian,

37:58.840 --> 38:00.920
all interconnected
and without room for error.

38:01.680 --> 38:03.640
First, Zhao Ming and I

38:03.720 --> 38:06.120
must each accept Hao Tian's descent
in the times of 10,000 years ago

38:06.200 --> 38:07.880
and 10,000 years later,

38:07.960 --> 38:09.360
transforming Hao Tian
into a physical entity.

38:09.440 --> 38:10.440
Then,

38:10.960 --> 38:12.720
we'll combine the power of Chaos and Fate

38:12.800 --> 38:15.160
to distort and merge

38:15.240 --> 38:16.760
the two times,

38:17.560 --> 38:20.280
creating a blind zone
beyond Hao Tian's control.

38:20.360 --> 38:22.720
This will place both versions
of Hao Tian into the same time and space.

38:22.800 --> 38:24.640
Finally, Demon Lord
and Zhao Ming will fight

38:24.720 --> 38:26.720
within the rule-free zone,

38:26.800 --> 38:28.360
destroying the two versions of Hao Tian.

38:28.440 --> 38:30.160
This plan is dangerous,

38:30.680 --> 38:31.520
filled with variables,

38:31.600 --> 38:34.000
yet it is the only method
with a chance of success.

38:34.520 --> 38:36.800
To bring about the dual descent
of Hao Tian

38:36.880 --> 38:37.800
and force mutual killing,

38:37.880 --> 38:39.680
we'll need the versions of ourselves
from both times

38:40.200 --> 38:41.240
to fight side by side

38:41.760 --> 38:42.720
across 10,000 years.

38:42.800 --> 38:44.800
Only the temporal power
of the Samsara Mirror

38:44.880 --> 38:47.840
can help us communicate
with our past selves,

38:47.920 --> 38:49.440
explain everything,

38:49.520 --> 38:51.800
and agree on how to resist Hao Tian.

39:10.080 --> 39:12.400
I've already returned
half of the Chaos Power to you entirely.

39:13.120 --> 39:14.800
You can meet the Samsara Mirror directly

39:14.880 --> 39:17.720
through the time swirl
and reclaim the temporal power.

39:53.000 --> 39:54.080
Your Grace.

40:03.480 --> 40:05.880
Greetings, Your Grace.

40:08.600 --> 40:09.880
It's been 10,000 years,

40:09.960 --> 40:11.520
and you're still the same as ever,

40:11.600 --> 40:13.800
unchanged in appearance.

40:13.880 --> 40:15.360
It's been 10,000 years,

40:15.880 --> 40:17.720
and Your Grace look as you did before.

40:18.560 --> 40:20.880
Yet, something is profoundly different.

40:22.600 --> 40:25.160
Now, my name is Mu Xuanling.

40:26.200 --> 40:28.520
It's a name I'm not unfamiliar with.

40:57.400 --> 40:58.440
That day, Xie Xuechen

40:58.520 --> 41:01.360
endured the trial
of 38,000 celestial winds,

41:01.440 --> 41:02.560
reaching here

41:04.600 --> 41:06.320
to save Mu Xuanling.

41:13.080 --> 41:14.360
When he left,

41:14.920 --> 41:16.040
did he say anything?

41:16.560 --> 41:17.640
He said many things,

41:17.720 --> 41:19.440
but to me,

41:19.520 --> 41:20.640
it was just two words.

41:21.840 --> 41:22.880
No regrets.

41:25.360 --> 41:26.320
For the past 10,000 years,

41:26.920 --> 41:28.800
I forgot where I came from,

41:28.880 --> 41:30.400
forgot the existence of Your Grace,

41:31.480 --> 41:33.160
and forgot who I was waiting for.

41:34.000 --> 41:35.640
It wasn't until Your Grace returned

41:36.160 --> 41:37.680
that I finally understood everything.

41:39.920 --> 41:41.320
Thanks so much

41:41.840 --> 41:42.680
for all this waiting.

41:44.000 --> 41:46.280
All things in this world
have their purpose.

41:46.800 --> 41:49.200
I'm honored
to have carried Your Grace's will,

41:49.920 --> 41:51.960
existing for 10,000 years,
witnessing the passage of time.

41:53.200 --> 41:55.240
Now, the Samsara Mirror
and the temporal power

41:56.040 --> 41:57.280
shall be returned to Your Grace.

41:57.800 --> 41:59.160
May Your Grace fulfill your wish,

42:00.040 --> 42:02.040
and may the world enjoy eternal harmony.

42:24.000 --> 42:25.840
I have reclaimed the temporal power.

42:25.920 --> 42:27.160
I can now control the Samsara Mirror

42:27.240 --> 42:29.360
to connect two times for dialogue.

42:29.440 --> 42:30.440
However, there is one condition

42:31.720 --> 42:32.880
to use this method.

42:33.440 --> 42:35.120
We must ensure the causality
of 10,000 years remain unchanged.

42:35.720 --> 42:37.880
Otherwise,
if anything from back then shifts,

42:37.960 --> 42:39.560
the present world

42:40.520 --> 42:43.000
-will collapse.
-Chaos Power can stabilize time and space,

42:43.680 --> 42:45.160
and the power of Fate
can stabilize cause and effect.

42:45.240 --> 42:47.400
When the time comes, I will join you

42:47.480 --> 42:50.120
to protect this world
from being disrupted by disorder.

42:51.120 --> 42:52.400
How long can the rule-free zone

42:53.280 --> 42:54.560
be maintained?

42:54.640 --> 42:56.240
Even if all our divine power is exhausted,

42:56.760 --> 42:58.240
it will last
only one incense stick's time.

42:58.960 --> 42:59.840
In other words,

43:00.360 --> 43:01.800
there will only be one chance

43:01.880 --> 43:03.960
to kill Hao Tian within that time.

43:08.320 --> 43:09.920
If the two versions of Hao Tian
kill each other,

43:10.600 --> 43:12.040
the survival chances

43:12.120 --> 43:14.160
of the vessels they possess will be slim.

43:14.960 --> 43:16.280
If I feared death,

43:17.400 --> 43:18.720
I wouldn't be standing here now.

43:23.200 --> 43:25.160
Between killing Hao Tian
and being controlled by him,

43:25.240 --> 43:26.880
I choose the former.

43:29.440 --> 43:30.360
Let's begin.
